  "ingredients": [
    "3 large egg (room temp)",
    "1 1/2 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1/8 teaspoon salt",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather your ingredients together. Make sure that the eggs and cream cheese are both at room temperature.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-heat the oven to 300F. Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Separate the eggs. Place the egg whites in a large mixing bowl, and the egg yolks in a smaller mixing bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using a hand mixer, beat the egg whites on high until stiff peaks form.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cream cheese, salt, and garlic to the egg yolks. Using an electric mixer, mix these together until they are smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add about 1/3 of the egg yolk mixture into the egg whites and gently fold together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once incorporated, add the remaining egg yolk mixture into the egg whites and fold together, making sure there are no white streaks in the batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scoop the batter onto the parchment-lined baking sheet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently spread into a circle. The more you spread the circle, the larger and flatter the cloud bread will be.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 15-18 minutes, or until slightly golden brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Cloud-bread-16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool on the baking sheet, then remove to cool completely. Use the cloud bread as desired (it’s great as sandwich bread or as a burger bun)!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-cloud-bread-oopsie-bread/#wprm-recipe-53457-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
